    "title": "MrBeast Hello Hoodie",
    "body_html": "<p>Hello to you too. The MrBeast Hello Hoodie is an <strong>official MrBeast hoodie</strong> that is fun, bold and impossible to miss. A <strong>\"Hello, my name is\" sticker graphic</strong> with pink graffiti \"MR BEAST\" lettering sits at the chest, while a <strong>large pink drip panther</strong> takes over the back, printed using <strong>puff printing</strong> for a soft, raised <strong>3D texture</strong>. Perfect for a <strong>house party</strong>, a <strong>street food market</strong>, or whenever the vibe calls for something playful.</p><p style=\"font-size: calc(1em + 2px); margin: 1.6em 0 0.4em 0;\"><strong>The Details</strong></p><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> <strong>100% cotton fleece</strong>, 350 GSM</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Fit:</strong> <strong>Oversized fit</strong> with a <strong>hood</strong>, <strong>kangaroo pocket</strong> and <strong>long sleeves</strong>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print:</strong> <strong>Direct-to-Film (DTF) print</strong> for long-lasting colour vibrancy</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Colour:</strong> <strong>Off White</strong>\n</li>\n</ul><p style=\"font-size: calc(1em + 2px); margin: 1.6em 0 0.4em 0;\"><strong>Care</strong></p><p>Machine wash <strong>cold</strong> with like colours. <strong>Do not bleach</strong>, and <strong>do not iron directly on the print</strong>.</p><p style=\"font-size: calc(1em + 2px); margin: 1.6em 0 0.4em 0;\"><strong>Authenticity &amp; Delivery</strong></p><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Authentic MrBeast merchandise</strong> from the official MrBeast store in India.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Pan-India delivery</strong>, 3-7 days after dispatch.</li>\n</ul>",
