    "title": "MrBeast Neon Panther Sweatshirt",
    "body_html": "<p>The MrBeast Neon Panther Sweatshirt is an <strong>official MrBeast sweatshirt</strong> you will reach for again and again. A full <strong>cyan Beast Panther</strong> with a <strong>hot pink lightning bolt</strong> at the chest, printed using <strong>high density printing</strong> for a thick, embossed finish you can see and feel. Great for <strong>meetups</strong>, <strong>fests</strong>, <strong>weekend hangouts</strong>, or a casual day out.</p><p style=\"font-size: calc(1em + 2px); margin: 1.6em 0 0.4em 0;\"><strong>The Details</strong></p><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> <strong>100% cotton fleece</strong>, 350 GSM</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Fit:</strong> <strong>Oversized fit</strong> with a <strong>crew neck</strong> and <strong>long sleeves</strong>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print:</strong> <strong>Direct-to-Film (DTF) print</strong> for long-lasting colour vibrancy</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Colours:</strong> <strong>Grey</strong> and <strong>Black</strong>\n</li>\n</ul><p style=\"font-size: calc(1em + 2px); margin: 1.6em 0 0.4em 0;\"><strong>Care</strong></p><p>Machine wash <strong>cold</strong> with like colours. <strong>Do not bleach</strong>, and <strong>do not iron directly on the print</strong>.</p><p style=\"font-size: calc(1em + 2px); margin: 1.6em 0 0.4em 0;\"><strong>Authenticity &amp; Delivery</strong></p><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Authentic MrBeast merchandise</strong> from the official MrBeast store in India.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Pan-India delivery</strong>, 3-7 days after dispatch.</li>\n</ul>",
