    "title": "MrBeast Patch Hoodie",
    "body_html": "<p>Clean, heavy and easy to wear. The MrBeast Patch Hoodie is an <strong>official MrBeast hoodie</strong> that keeps it simple: a small <strong>\"BEAST\" patch at the chest</strong> on a heavyweight fleece base. It goes with everything, from <strong>college days</strong> to <strong>late-night drives</strong> and <strong>weekend layering</strong>.</p><p style=\"font-size: calc(1em + 2px); margin: 1.6em 0 0.4em 0;\"><strong>The Details</strong></p><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> <strong>100% cotton fleece</strong>, 350 GSM</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Fit:</strong> <strong>Oversized fit</strong> with a <strong>hood</strong>, <strong>kangaroo pocket</strong> and <strong>long sleeves</strong>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Finish:</strong> <strong>\"BEAST\" patch</strong> at the chest</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Colours:</strong> <strong>Off White</strong>, <strong>Grey</strong> and <strong>Black</strong>\n</li>\n</ul><p style=\"font-size: calc(1em + 2px); margin: 1.6em 0 0.4em 0;\"><strong>Care</strong></p><p>Machine wash <strong>cold</strong> with like colours. <strong>Do not bleach</strong>, and <strong>do not iron directly on the patch</strong>.</p><p style=\"font-size: calc(1em + 2px); margin: 1.6em 0 0.4em 0;\"><strong>Authenticity &amp; Delivery</strong></p><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Authentic MrBeast merchandise</strong> from the official MrBeast store in India.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Pan-India delivery</strong>, 3-7 days after dispatch.</li>\n</ul>",
